    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d120">

                <pb facs="0227" n="151" xml:id="pg151"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">660F.116/176: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Czechoslovakia</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Wright</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Praha</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1935-08-01T11:00:00+01:00">August 1, 1935—11
                        a.m.</date><lb/>[Received August 1—9:20 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>30. My despatch No. 206, June 25.<anchor n="23" xml:id="d120-f1"/> Government
                    decree published today effective August 1–October 31 reduces import duty lard to
                    200 crowns and fatbacks to 150 crowns per 100 kilos. Alleged discrimination
                    referred to in your instruction 67 is being investigated.</p>
                <p>Please inform Commerce.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Wright</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
